Alembic revision files live in `versions/`.

Generate migrations (empty DB recommended for the first run):

```bash
cd backend
export PYTHONPATH=.
export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/mba_admissions
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
alembic upgrade head
```

`env.py` converts `DATABASE_URL` to a sync `postgresql+psycopg://` URL automatically.
